{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39f37a983ae51b0417627abe580f1c0e6064da8c5a2ebb844b1e16028896c71d",
      "text": "那个……。我也一样。\n对于重大的工作和责任，我非常不擅长，也很害怕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:109013c6437962e587084081b49d8773b731f1a1bb499dacb6f1cbfbb49ebd58",
      "text": "但是，能够给予像我这样的人力量的，\n我认为正是偶像。所、所以……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702bb051594d41eb714451bea54a972e71ccc5f0f1d80bca2b28ae8d7824e31f",
      "text": "我们，不仅会为主办方加油，也会为全体工作人员加油！\n……大家一起，把大会办下去好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ccc3e173f0472b7f9286c162505f36d335e0a96218c4e98301f77fd704c028",
      "text": "就是呀，感到害怕的话，有花音我们在呀！\n搞砸了的时候我们也在呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5577f11da9db5d0e1917e527ef26a31e23435958b237a31b0630dfbdbc69b3c0",
      "text": "只要和大家在一起，无论何时都能努力坚持下去的哦。\n对吧，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d738ab459133dec6474f364d0c9a77532c2555d6c928f1d18ed5bfaa6bee9d1",
      "text": "是啊。……要不要再一起把男极办下去呢？\n多亏了男极，315 Pro才能更进一步地成长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:560e1d63ece47d4b10a04e5116409e1ba76799eae5466e1793e179f9d02ca73d",
      "text": "每经历一场战斗就变得越发高大的偶像们的身姿，\n想必您也是看在眼里的。这份力量，直到最后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cea021ed2d694f5fa51f331251c7c9a3d4b079c9ad1473629e8cea957dbb2e8",
      "text": "…………哼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dab41f44f090e689c93b39a62157dd9538d089a5a1b3f080772e5ac2303347f",
      "text": "啊！……走了。\n话才说到一半居然就直接走掉了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6447d4c29d43066d34579990a5397246abf1a7d2e9d9e21f0034eb3fb22d24c",
      "text": "……。他或许是不相信偶像的力量……。\n又或许，只是遗忘了而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ffdc6f6854fd7aa7810a952b24854cfa8bc775a1319fd36019660e9360b9be2",
      "text": "……既然这样，就由我们来帮他想起来吧。\n在节目当天，展现出超绝帅气的演技给他看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1a080620c51def78555ad493f0d04e82fb3b72e0c75019bffa1f5dc043a02b5",
      "text": "毕竟，看到帅气的东西时，\n觉得帅气的心情是压抑不住的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a55908c45c1f1517d10fdbe746a69360041a3fe42e02110f5fe2fcaeec1909ad",
      "text": "志狼君。也要让他看到可爱的一面才行哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_i:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4ba53ec3215d9e20909c01305c66fa5972215316bff4c68649c43e989993553",
      "text": "もふもふえん可是既帅气又可爱、\n值得依靠的闪闪发光的组合呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
